[{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，唔……」","art":{"background":"a0","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"有点呼吸困难……身子好热……好热啊……","art":{"background":"a0","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"怎么会这么热……？","art":{"background":"a0","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且好沉啊。身体沉重得动不了，就连翻身都做不到。","art":{"background":"a0","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"难不成……是我感冒了……？","art":{"background":"a0","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「呼……呼……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「朝武……？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"……我看到幻觉了。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"不妙啊，我的脑子已经病入膏肓了吗，竟然能看到幻觉。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"我还是再睡一会儿吧……还好离晨练开始还有一段时间。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a0","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「呼……呼……唔、唔……呼……」","art":{"background":"a0","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「哇呀！？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"她的气息吹到了我的耳朵上！？","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"到底是怎么一回事！？她怎么会和我睡在同一个被窝里！？","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「嗯，唔……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「——嗯！？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"朝武环抱住了我的脖子。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（哇……好香啊……）」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不对！」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然我知道她每天早上都很难清醒……但没想到居然会弄错房间！？","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……呼……唔，嗯，唔」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「——嗯！？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"我求你了别再贴过来了！从刚才开始我耳边就一直回荡着妖艳的呼吸声！","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"这乱人心弦的呼吸声本来并没有什么特殊含义。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"然而当它和朝武的体香混在一起时……我的脑子就无法正常思考了！","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"这谁顶得住啊！","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「朝武，拜托你快放开我的脖子吧」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……不要……我拒绝……呼……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「等、等一下……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"听这呼吸声，感觉她好像又睡过去了。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且睡得非常沉，已经完全听不见我的声音了。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这可怎么办啊……？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"朝武环抱着我的颈部，身体紧紧地贴着我。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（好、好软啊！）」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"我可以直接感受到她的体温以及柔软的触感。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且……我还能看见她胸前的深谷。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"要是衣服再错开一些，肯定就能看到那粉色的凸起了……","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……朝武身材娇小，这里却相当大啊……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"不行不行！我怎么可以趁她熟睡时非礼她！","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「朝武，朝武啊」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……嗯，唔……呼……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「呀！呼、呼吸又吹到我耳朵上了……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"不行。要是我轻易和她搭话，她没准会抱得更紧。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"再这样下去我的脖子就要被勒住了。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「嗯，嗯……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「——吓！？你、你在啊！？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本座心想差不多是时候叫你起床了……但真没想到你们已经发展到这个地步了」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「莫非你们昨晚真的是准备颠鸾倒凤，同谐鱼水之欢？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「真的不是啊。我们这并不是事后，你听我解释——」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「什么！？原来是正准备开始……本座是不是打扰到你们了？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「待会儿还要去锻炼呢……你腰身顶得住吗？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「用不着你瞎操心！」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不过你真的误会了，不要再瞎说了！」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「是吗……是本座误会了啊……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「啊，嗯……不要……唔」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「哦，这是误会啊」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「真的是误会！」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「有地，你起来了吗？那我进来了哦」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「都已经过了起床时间了，难道你今天不去训练……了？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"进到房间里的常陆突然定格在原地。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"然后又突然动了起来，而且嘴角还露出了下流的坏笑。","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「实在抱歉，竟然打搅了二位享受事后清晨的余韵。我这就去帮你们做好入浴的准备」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这不是事后！」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哎？难道是正准备开始……？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个玩笑刚才已经有人开过了！」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「早上的锻炼是改成腰部运动了吗？哎哟，你们真是青春无限好啊」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你这个说法未免太恶心了吧」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哎……是这样吗？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这只是朝武睡糊涂了而已啊」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「她早上不是经常犯迷糊吗，肯定是走错房间了」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「再怎么意识模糊也不会走错房间吧？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「就算走错了，至于和你抱得那么紧吗？」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「嗯嗯……我抱……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子・丛雨","text":"『……盯……』","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「好吧，这种情况下不管我说什么都没有说服力……」","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"我自己也知道这点……","art":{"background":"a1341","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「嗯……唔……」","art":{"background":"a1342","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们这样闹来闹去，终于把朝武给吵醒了。","art":{"background":"a1342","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"她睡眼惺忪，半睁着眼和我对上了视线。","art":{"background":"a1342","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你醒了啊？」","art":{"background":"a1342","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……哎……？」","art":{"background":"a1342","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"她一脸茫然地仰望着我，声音就像泄了气的皮球一样，跟平时完全不同。","art":{"background":"a1342","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"我也不知道我们这样对视了多久。","art":{"background":"a1342","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"突然，她睁大了眼睛。这时她的眼神才终于恢复了理智。","art":{"background":"a1342","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「哎哎哎！？」","art":{"background":"a1343","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「早上好」","art":{"background":"a1343","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「有、有、有地！？哎？哎！？为、为什么有地会在我的房间里！？」","art":{"background":"a1343","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「而、而且为什么我们睡……」","art":{"background":"a1344","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「睡、睡在……睡在了一起……！？」","art":{"background":"a1343","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「哇呀！？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1345","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"朝武飞一般地从我身边离开。","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1345","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「奇、奇怪……这里不是我的房间……！？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1346","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你不记得自己是怎么来的？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1346","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「你不是跑来幽会的吗？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a812","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「幽幽幽幽幽会！？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1347","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哎唷……真有勇气……」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1348","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「不是的，我怎么可能会来幽会呢！」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1349","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a256","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「然而现实是，您确实在有地的房间和他共同迎来了清晨的第一缕阳光呀？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1349","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a256","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「这个……我、我都不记得我为什么会睡在这里……」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1350","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a256","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「难道是无意识间就钻进了主人的被窝？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a265","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我、我不知道啊！我一醒来就看到了有地的脸。而且……而且还那样子抱在一起」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1351","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「唔…………」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1338","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"朝武红着脸低下了头。","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1338","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"从她这样子看来，她是真的不记得自己做了什么。","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1338","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「会不会有点奇怪啊？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「就算朝武早上再怎么糊涂，也不至于到我房间里来啊」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「从她房间到我房间还要过起居室呢」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「对、对啊。这件事好蹊跷啊」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1350","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「确实如此。芳乃大人之前也从未梦游过」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1350","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a628","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「难道朝武不是主动过来的，而是另有原因……？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1350","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a628","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然我搞不懂到底是什么原因。","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1350","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a628","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「唔……芳乃，昨天夜里你有发现什么奇怪的事吗？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a132","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「再怎么不起眼的事都好。有什么和以往不一样的吗？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a312","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我想想……昨天……我心里痒痒的，根本睡不着」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1352","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「心里痒痒的？那现在怎么样了？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1353","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1354","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「现、现在吗？唔……这个……」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1353","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1355","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「现在心还是跳得很快，我也不是很清楚……十分抱歉」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1353","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1356","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「那主人你怎么样？有没有察觉到什么变化？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1357","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我、我吗？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1357","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"我注意到的事……也就只有朝武头上那对耳朵了。","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1357","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"这个想不注意到都难。","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1357","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"她自己、常陆以及小雨都没着重提这点，说明这种事以前也发生过。","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1357","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"要说还有什么别的……唔……","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1357","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我想想……其实我到现在都还静不下心来」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1357","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「到现在我的心还在怦怦直跳……」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1357","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a373","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，没事……就是感觉心跳得太快了，有点晕……」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a373","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"身上好像有那么一点点不自然的感觉。","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"感觉就像是双腿站不稳一样。","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"这发了烧一样的感觉是怎么回事……","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人，宿体呢？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a131","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「按你说的，我把它放在丛雨丸旁边了」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a131","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"正当我伸出手去拿宿体时，我才注意到……","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「宿体……变红了？」","art":{"background":"a1358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"确切地说，宿体是在断断续续地闪烁着红色的光。","art":{"background":"a1358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"简直就像是跳动的心脏一样……","art":{"background":"a1358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「难道说是祟神……？」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a1345","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「可、可是美津叶大夫说祟神出现时它会变黑，应该不会变红啊」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a144","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a279","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「茉子，有一件事需要拜托你。可否去一个地方帮本座确认一下」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a134","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a279","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯，是美津叶大夫的诊所吧」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a134","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1034","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「不，本座想让你去志那都庄」","art":{"background":"a275","sprites":[{"asset":"a384","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"于是常陆便动身前往志那都庄。","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"没过多久她就带着蕾娜一起回来了。","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「嗯……」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a1359","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且蕾娜的表情有些痛苦。","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a1359","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「突然叫你过来，真是抱歉」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a196","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1359","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「没事，这倒没关系」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a196","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1360","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「能否说说自己现在身体感觉如何？突然出了点事，还请见谅」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a1353","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1360","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我到了这里就开始耳鸣。虽然也不是很严重……」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a1353","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a961","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「真是因这红色宿体的影响？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a1151","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「八成是」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a226","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「也就是我、朝武还有蕾娜会受到影响……」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a226","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「难道是诅咒的力量变强了？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a168","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a318","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「在我们收集了碎片以后，它的力量必然有所增强」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a144","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a318","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「可是……诅咒本身似乎并没有变强」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a132","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那这到底是怎么一回事……？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a132","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「它或许是在呼唤其他碎片？也就是正在将力量化作信号发射出去」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a226","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个“它”，就是宿体变红的原因……也是控制了朝武的元凶……？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a226","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「这个元凶……导致我被宿体附身了……？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a1269","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「被附身？我有点听不太懂，芳乃要被谁附身了吗？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a1361","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1269","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「不，这倒不用担心」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a145","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「只可能在无意识的时候被附身，而且仅限夜晚，因为晚上宿体的力量更强」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a282","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「也就是说，这并不是附身，而是身体接收到了信号啊」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a282","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「这么说的话……昨晚之所以心里不平静，都是宿体的信号惹的祸……也是，我就说嘛。太好了，这下真相大白了……」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a1362","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「朝武？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a1362","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「没没没没事，你不用在意！话说我们得赶紧想个对策才行」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a1157","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「没错。但又不可能为了避免接收信号而彻夜不眠」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a1157","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「这个嘛……本座认为我们说不定可以利用这个信号」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a139","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「利用？」","art":{"background":"a211","sprites":[{"asset":"a139","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……吸……呼……吸……呼……」","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a1363","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「芳乃，你不用那么紧张的。现在开始你要睡过去才行啊」","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a1357","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1364","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「您说得倒是轻巧，我怎么可能不紧张啊。我可是第一次穿巫女服睡觉」","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a1357","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1365","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「而且更重要的是……」","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a1366","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「就这样把身体拱手让给宿体，真的没关系吗？」","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a207","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1367","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「虽说是将身体拱手相让，但对方并不是封印在宿体内的怨念」","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a1309","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1367","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「因此，芳乃的身体只会被用来收集碎片，并不会遭遇什么不测……吧，大概，或许，八成是这样的」","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a204","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1367","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「您怎么越说越不确定，不要吓我啊。说得我都越来越担心了……」","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a1368","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「这种事只能尝试尝试，否则任谁都说不准」","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a213","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-6"}]